{"id":"a1fddb2090fe6a3d","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-weak-srandom.md","title":"弱 s 随机与弱 s 测试","display":"df-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机与弱 s 测试","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-weak-srandom","aliases":["43-df-weak-srandom"],"display":"df-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机与弱 s 测试","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.17.4.1, printed p.518 / PDF p.538","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-weak-srandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-weak-srandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机与弱 s 测试"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.17.4.1, printed p.518 / PDF p.538"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenHull}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenHull}\\)</span> 与圆柱见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\sum_{\\sigma\\in V_k}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\sum_{\\sigma\\in V_k}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用具体 c.e. 串覆盖及 s 权重，避免未定义“开放集的 s 测度”。限定有理 s 使权重统一有效。柱集并采用 OpenHull，避免与树的路径集 [T] 混用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]；$\\operatorname{OpenHull}$ 与圆柱见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]；$\\operatorname{OpenHull}$ 与圆柱见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"V=(V_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OpenHull}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{<\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\sum_{\\sigma\\in V_k}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k}.\n\\qquad\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{<\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\,[\\mathrm{WeakSTest}_s(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)].","display":true}],"bytes